OL,3,GNEWSA'The Queen told us off for riding
OL,4,Atricycles indoors'
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of Princess Margaret's former
OL,7,Fladies in waiting recalls being told
OL,8,Foff by a nine-year-old Queen Elizabeth
OL,9,FII for riding a tricycle indoors at her
OL,10,FNorfolk stately home.
OL,12,FLady Glenconner, who has known the
OL,13,FRoyal Family all her life, said it was
OL,14,Fa privilege growing up at Holkham Hall,
OL,15,Fwhich is her family's ancestral estate.
OL,17,FNow aged 94, she remembers riding
OL,18,Ftricycles as a young child with the
OL,19,FQueen's younger sister, Princess
OL,20,FMargaret - and being chided by the
OL,21,Ffuture monarch.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,377,370,200,160,0,100
