OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'The Queen told us off for riding
OL,4,Atricycles indoors'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We weren't meant to be there at all,
OL,7,Fgoing round and round, and down the
OL,8,Fsteps of the Marble Hall came the
OL,9,FQueen... she looked at us and she said
OL,10,F'Margaret, Anne, very very naughty,
OL,11,Fwhat are you doing'?" said Lady
OL,12,FGlenconner.
